1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 3]

34
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:57,300
[Yun Jin, Noble Consort of Yong]

35
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:02,440
Your Highness.

36
00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:04,970
You certainly are busy, Lord Pei.

37
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,420
I've summoned you several times,

38
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,010
yet you've always found an excuse
not to come.

39
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,100
What?

40
00:02:10,710 --> 00:02:12,730
Is it really that hard for me
to see you?

41
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,130
Forgive me, Your Highness.

42
00:02:14,610 --> 00:02:15,620
I've been occupied with official duties

43
00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:16,660
and couldn't get away.

44
00:02:17,780 --> 00:02:18,560
Never mind.

45
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,240
I called you here this time

46
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,150
to ask

47
00:02:22,150 --> 00:02:23,160
who was behind

48
00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:24,970
the mine incident.

49
00:02:26,570 --> 00:02:27,220
Forgive me, Your Highness.

50
00:02:27,590 --> 00:02:28,310
By court decree,

51
00:02:28,770 --> 00:02:29,700
the harem may not interfere
in state affairs.

52
00:02:30,230 --> 00:02:31,000
I'm afraid

53
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:31,760
I can't tell you.

54
00:02:40,510 --> 00:02:41,140
Why did His Majesty summon you

55
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:42,090
so urgently?

56
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,190
It was the Noble Consort.

57
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:45,230
She asked me about the Blood Jade Mine.

58
00:02:45,870 --> 00:02:46,920
So it wasn't His Majesty?

59
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:47,960
She dared forge an imperial summons?

60
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:53,870
And in the Imperial Study, no less.

61
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:57,340
Even if His Majesty favors her,

62
00:02:57,910 --> 00:02:59,280
she comes and goes
from the Imperial Study

63
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,120
as if it were her own.

64
00:03:00,670 --> 00:03:01,620
That's ridiculous.

65
00:03:02,190 --> 00:03:03,200
Does His Majesty allow this?

66
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:05,750
His Majesty has few heirs.

67
00:03:05,830 --> 00:03:07,230
Only the Crown Prince came of age.

68
00:03:07,650 --> 00:03:09,330
He was placed in her care at birth.

69
00:03:09,780 --> 00:03:11,120
She devoted herself to him

70
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:11,920
and raised him as her own.

71
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:13,830
His Majesty appreciates all she's done,

72
00:03:14,190 --> 00:03:14,930
so he rarely restrains her.

73
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,080
Your Highness.

74
00:03:28,410 --> 00:03:29,500
Pei Zhao doesn't know his place.

75
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,700
We should teach him a lesson.

76
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,400
That's exactly
what I like about Pei Zhao.

77
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,430
That untamed spirit of his.

78
00:03:38,870 --> 00:03:40,240
From high to low at court,

79
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,310
within and beyond the imperial palace,

80
00:03:42,470 --> 00:03:43,750
there's no second Pei Zhao.

81
00:03:45,350 --> 00:03:46,690
Qingyan has everything going for him.

82
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,430
He just lacks

83
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:51,100
that fire Pei Zhao has.

84
00:03:53,330 --> 00:03:54,180
You too.

85
00:03:54,770 --> 00:03:56,190
You should learn from Pei Zhao.

86
00:03:57,750 --> 00:03:58,510
Yes.

87
00:03:59,530 --> 00:04:00,850
I will heed your words, Your Highness.

88
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,820
Was it your little sister
the Fengyi Bureau brought in?

89
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,500
I heard she's an abandoned mistress.

90
00:04:09,030 --> 00:04:10,750
My sister is gentle and beautiful.

91
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:11,580
It can't be her.

92
00:04:16,950 --> 00:04:17,470
Leave.

93
00:04:20,190 --> 00:04:20,750
Yes.

94
00:04:26,630 --> 00:04:29,130
Even an abandoned woman
can catch Pei Zhao's eye.

95
00:04:29,750 --> 00:04:31,660
Yun Qi is truly simple-minded

96
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:32,840
and of little use.

97
00:04:33,170 --> 00:04:34,270
I can't count on him.

98
00:04:35,470 --> 00:04:36,010
Someone.

99
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:41,980
[To Han Jin, Prince of Xin'an]

100
00:04:42,580 --> 00:04:43,920
Send this letter.

101
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,640
Yes.

102
00:04:55,440 --> 00:04:57,860
Come take a look.

103
00:05:12,530 --> 00:05:13,950
Bring Pei Zhao to the Ghost Market.

104
00:05:36,140 --> 00:05:39,500
[Xiao Ruoli, Ghost Market proprietor]

105
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:45,430
Sir.

106
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:45,980
A secret letter.

107
00:05:48,180 --> 00:05:48,800
Read it.

108
00:05:49,890 --> 00:05:50,610
Pei Zhao is useful.

109
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:51,290
Do not act.

110
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:56,390
What use is a Wingless scum?

111
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:58,670
Pei Zhao escaped unharmed.

112
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,750
Could he know how to remove the Gu?

113
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,570
No one survives

114
00:06:03,570 --> 00:06:04,860
once infected with my Gu.

115
00:06:05,350 --> 00:06:06,740
Let's see if, in seven days,

116
00:06:07,580 --> 00:06:10,040
he can still open
those darn eyes of his.

117
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,380
I want his head

118
00:06:14,070 --> 00:06:15,640
to add some excitement

119
00:06:16,130 --> 00:06:16,880
to the Blood Jade Ritual.

120
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:19,240
Yes.

121
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,050
Sir, have a drink.

122
00:06:28,020 --> 00:06:29,860
[Ghost Market]

123
00:06:30,890 --> 00:06:31,290
Sir.

124
00:06:32,570 --> 00:06:33,760
This is Ghost Market's finest shop.

125
00:06:35,570 --> 00:06:37,250
We might find a cure
for the mother-child Gu here.

126
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,250
Whatever Gu you have,

127
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,960
this creature can prolong your life.

128
00:06:44,590 --> 00:06:46,240
Just 100 taels of gold each.

129
00:06:46,660 --> 00:06:47,430
How many do you want?

130
00:06:48,570 --> 00:06:49,100
Two.

131
00:06:49,810 --> 00:06:50,700
Let's keep you both alive first.

132
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,480
Not even one.

133
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,620
That so-called prolongation

134
00:06:57,970 --> 00:06:59,240
only drains your vital energy.

135
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,320
It's no true remedy.

136
00:07:00,950 --> 00:07:02,240
The Gu inside me

137
00:07:02,390 --> 00:07:03,720
are keeping each other in check

138
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:04,530
and keeping each other alive.

139
00:07:06,020 --> 00:07:06,830
I'm safe for now.

140
00:07:08,270 --> 00:07:10,960
Finding a real way to remove it
is what matters.

141
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:13,070
If you already know that,

142
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:14,700
what are you doing here?

143
00:07:33,260 --> 00:07:34,280
What can I do for you, sir?

144
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:38,260
Your nose is useful enough.

145
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:41,880
From now on, stay by my side.

146
00:07:44,410 --> 00:07:46,040
You're letting me stay?

147
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:47,980
Only as my attendant.

148
00:07:49,910 --> 00:07:50,640
Don't wander off

149
00:07:51,300 --> 00:07:51,920
without my permission.

150
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:55,600
Don't ask or look where you shouldn't.

151
00:07:56,270 --> 00:07:58,740
Otherwise, I'll gouge out your eyes.

152
00:07:59,200 --> 00:07:59,610
Yes.

153
00:08:09,190 --> 00:08:09,790
Put this on.

154
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,480
Keep your face hidden.

155
00:08:15,190 --> 00:08:16,310
Thank you, sir.

156
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:17,190
Leave.

157
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:21,600
Come back.

158
00:08:27,200 --> 00:08:29,890
Yun Qi's always been obsessed with her

159
00:08:30,660 --> 00:08:31,680
and treated her well.

160
00:08:34,910 --> 00:08:35,780
You and Yun Qi

161
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:37,890
were really that close?

162
00:08:42,470 --> 00:08:46,210
Closer than you think.

163
00:08:48,750 --> 00:08:49,120
Get out.

164
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:03,970
[Miners' Register]
Could Father's name be in this register?

165
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:08,010
Where have you been all these years?

166
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:11,710
Is that all you've got?

167
00:09:13,170 --> 00:09:14,560
If it doesn't
reach Tianxuan Village today,

168
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:15,780
you'll all die.

169
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:16,550
Hurry.

170
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:21,220
Sir.

171
00:09:21,940 --> 00:09:22,870
The autopsy results are in.

172
00:09:25,780 --> 00:09:27,340
[Autopsy Report]

173
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:29,000
Sichuan peppercorns were found
at the scene,

174
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:32,120
but they had nothing to do
with the villagers' deaths.

175
00:09:33,570 --> 00:09:34,730
We found the secret tunnel used
to smuggle blood jade.

176
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,000
It was indeed mined
from the Blood Jade Mine.

177
00:09:39,460 --> 00:09:41,560
But Chen Daohua guards the mine.

178
00:09:42,820 --> 00:09:43,470
We can't get in.

179
00:09:44,550 --> 00:09:45,270
Go to Tianxuan Village.

180
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:50,230
The Blood Jade Mine connects
to the mountain behind the village.

181
00:09:50,660 --> 00:09:52,110
We'll search there.

182
00:10:15,230 --> 00:10:16,800
You fool. Have you a death wish?

183
00:10:17,110 --> 00:10:18,120
What did I do?

184
00:10:18,660 --> 00:10:19,910
I was just hitting a snake.

185
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:21,390
Ji Chang'an said you're reasonable.

186
00:10:21,390 --> 00:10:22,740
You don't seem reasonable at all.

187
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:26,460
All right. Stop looking.

188
00:10:26,710 --> 00:10:27,810
Go get some rest.

189
00:10:40,430 --> 00:10:41,840
Wildflowers bloom wherever they please.

190
00:10:42,700 --> 00:10:44,810
Fragrant grass blooms beyond spring.

191
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:49,630
So this is what that poem meant.

192
00:10:50,740 --> 00:10:52,260
The village is near the Blood Jade Mine.

193
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:53,860
And the blood jade nourishes
all living things,

194
00:10:54,450 --> 00:10:56,780
so the plants here thrive more
than elsewhere.

195
00:10:57,980 --> 00:10:58,280
Sir.

196
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:04,160
Lu Li said you haven't eaten yet.

197
00:11:06,130 --> 00:11:07,350
You were kind enough to take me in.

198
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:08,530
I eat and drink here for free

199
00:11:08,850 --> 00:11:09,840
and even cause you trouble.

200
00:11:14,330 --> 00:11:15,480
Enough with the sarcasm.

201
00:11:23,940 --> 00:11:24,640
So tasty.

202
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:26,420
What's this?

203
00:11:26,620 --> 00:11:27,650
It's so delicious.

204
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,810
You've never had a steamed bun?

205
00:11:32,180 --> 00:11:33,220
Yun Qi treated you that badly?

206
00:11:36,730 --> 00:11:38,830
Shao, you were born frail.

207
00:11:38,980 --> 00:11:40,070
You mustn't eat meat.

208
00:11:40,570 --> 00:11:41,730
These plants are light and mild

209
00:11:41,980 --> 00:11:42,920
and good for your health.

210
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,240
The Yun family is powerful.

211
00:11:45,710 --> 00:11:46,670
Once this is over,

212
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,060
I'll help you leave.

213
00:11:58,590 --> 00:11:59,360
There's only water.

214
00:11:59,540 --> 00:12:00,060
Have some.

215
00:12:08,380 --> 00:12:08,850
Stop it.

216
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:10,440
Huh?

217
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,020
Never mind.

218
00:12:15,730 --> 00:12:17,460
How did you learn to make incense?

219
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:18,910
And how do you know about

220
00:12:19,140 --> 00:12:19,840
killing with fragrance?

221
00:12:20,250 --> 00:12:20,870
It was my friend.

222
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:24,080
Incense recipes and incense making.

223
00:12:25,100 --> 00:12:25,800
One spoonful of this.

224
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:28,630
Two of this.

225
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:30,630
Mm.

226
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,130
It's a craft passed down in her family.

227
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:42,430
Sir, slow down.

228
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:47,090
We've walked so far, yet can't get out.

229
00:12:47,820 --> 00:12:50,430
I smell a very strange floral scent.

230
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,820
Do you know what flower it is?

231
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:00,340
Move.

232
00:13:11,220 --> 00:13:11,650
Sir.

233
00:13:12,330 --> 00:13:12,950
Sir.

234
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:14,580
This is killing my back.

235
00:13:22,350 --> 00:13:24,720
Sir, where's your sword?

236
00:13:36,820 --> 00:13:37,180
Sir.

237
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:39,320
I think I know
why they looked scared stiff.

238
00:13:45,900 --> 00:13:48,150
Sir, I read about this in a book.

239
00:13:48,620 --> 00:13:49,460
This is datura.

240
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,750
Its scent can cause hallucinations.

241
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:54,690
But datura alone

242
00:13:55,950 --> 00:13:57,460
isn't strong enough to kill.

243
00:13:58,180 --> 00:13:59,000
Plus the blood jade.

244
00:14:00,610 --> 00:14:01,030
Right.

245
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,780
Those villagers had Blood Jade shards
stuffed in their mouths.

246
00:14:06,590 --> 00:14:08,170
Blood jade heightens the senses.

247
00:14:08,170 --> 00:14:10,200
It worsens hallucinations and breathing

248
00:14:10,470 --> 00:14:11,790
until their hearts stopped.

249
00:14:12,140 --> 00:14:12,960
The crows went mad

250
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:15,120
after eating blood-jade grass seeds.

251
00:14:17,220 --> 00:14:19,940
The smuggling tunnel should be nearby.

252
00:14:21,730 --> 00:14:23,030
Where's the entrance?

253
00:14:31,470 --> 00:14:33,790
Sir, the cave here has collapsed.

254
00:14:34,190 --> 00:14:35,570
The tunnels inside must be destroyed.

255
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,140
That proves nothing.

256
00:14:40,820 --> 00:14:41,530
Let's head back.

257
00:14:41,540 --> 00:14:43,160
Wait, I...

258
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:57,860
Hold this.

259
00:14:58,590 --> 00:14:59,090
I'll pull you along.

260
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:02,270
No need. I just need a moment.

261
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:03,570
Don't waste time.

262
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,090
- Sir.
- Sir.

263
00:15:11,090 --> 00:15:11,750
Madam Xu.

264
00:15:12,540 --> 00:15:12,800
Sir.

265
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:13,340
- Sir.
- Sir.

266
00:15:15,370 --> 00:15:16,560
- Sir.
- Sir.

267
00:15:17,070 --> 00:15:17,610
Xiao Ruoming.

268
00:15:20,700 --> 00:15:22,180
The secret tunnel is nearby.

269
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:23,220
Take some men and search the area.

270
00:15:23,330 --> 00:15:24,370
See if there are any other exits.

271
00:15:25,030 --> 00:15:25,440
Yes.

272
00:15:25,890 --> 00:15:26,240
Lu Li.

273
00:15:26,790 --> 00:15:28,320
Trace the Sichuan pepper and datura.

274
00:15:28,820 --> 00:15:29,100
Yes.

275
00:15:29,540 --> 00:15:30,060
Ji Chang'an.

276
00:15:31,410 --> 00:15:31,770
Stay here

277
00:15:31,780 --> 00:15:33,290
and clear out all the datura.

278
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:35,190
By myself?

279
00:15:36,390 --> 00:15:37,570
The rest return with me
to Tianxuan Village.

280
00:15:38,860 --> 00:15:40,580
[Tianxuan Village]
Lord Pei.

281
00:15:40,590 --> 00:15:42,360
General Chen,
who guards the Blood Jade Mine,

282
00:15:42,930 --> 00:15:44,960
has taken all the men in the village.

283
00:15:47,580 --> 00:15:48,060
Move.

284
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:51,750
Hurry.

285
00:15:52,060 --> 00:15:52,540
Faster.

286
00:15:54,970 --> 00:15:55,600
Keep moving.

287
00:15:58,390 --> 00:16:00,590
General Chen accused us
of stealing blood jade.

288
00:16:00,830 --> 00:16:03,870
Every man over sixteen
will be put to death.

289
00:16:04,510 --> 00:16:06,080
They left me here

290
00:16:06,270 --> 00:16:07,590
so I could send word

291
00:16:07,590 --> 00:16:09,390
to the men who escaped.

292
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:11,440
If they don't turn themselves in,

293
00:16:12,170 --> 00:16:16,080
women and children here
will be slaughtered.

294
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:17,650
[The Wingless]
We're Wingless.

295
00:16:17,650 --> 00:16:18,320
[The lowest class of slaves in Yong,
enslaved for generations]

296
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:20,130
[Forbidden from ever leaving slave status]
The general's word is law.

297
00:16:20,170 --> 00:16:21,240
We dare not disobey.

298
00:16:21,810 --> 00:16:23,680
Please save us, Lord Pei.

299
00:16:24,540 --> 00:16:25,650
Please save us.

300
00:16:26,180 --> 00:16:26,580
Get up.

301
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:30,120
- Sir.
- Sir.

302
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:32,360
Sir.

303
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:34,550
Why are you here?

304
00:16:35,190 --> 00:16:36,150
The garrison came.

305
00:16:36,380 --> 00:16:37,320
They found a lot of blood jade

306
00:16:37,410 --> 00:16:39,220
hidden in the flower fields.

307
00:16:40,510 --> 00:16:41,320
They said it was all stolen

308
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,420
and sent me back.

309
00:16:43,150 --> 00:16:43,870
But there was no blood jade
in the fields

310
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:46,050
when we left.

311
00:17:08,940 --> 00:17:11,300
[Chen Daohua, Commander
of the Blood Jade Mine Garrison]

312
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:13,030
General Chen.

313
00:17:14,660 --> 00:17:15,170
Lord Pei.

314
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:17,840
We found stolen blood jade

315
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:19,660
in these villagers' homes.

316
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:20,940
The evidence is conclusive.

317
00:17:21,570 --> 00:17:22,920
They deserve to die.

318
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:25,180
That'll save you

319
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,900
the trouble of investigating.

320
00:17:27,630 --> 00:17:28,160
Guards.

321
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,400
Confession statement?

322
00:17:36,890 --> 00:17:37,950
These villagers

323
00:17:38,590 --> 00:17:40,710
defied the law and stole blood jade.

324
00:17:45,270 --> 00:17:46,150
Wow.

325
00:17:46,590 --> 00:17:47,770
The capital is beautiful.

326
00:17:53,130 --> 00:17:53,610
Careful.

327
00:18:04,870 --> 00:18:06,120
This is to leave no one alive
to testify.

328
00:18:19,730 --> 00:18:22,540
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

329
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:27,350
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

330
00:18:28,670 --> 00:18:30,410
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

331
00:18:30,910 --> 00:18:35,350
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

332
00:18:37,510 --> 00:18:40,180
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

333
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:46,410
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

334
00:18:46,730 --> 00:18:54,760
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

335
00:18:55,030 --> 00:19:03,650
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

336
00:19:03,650 --> 00:19:12,320
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

337
00:19:12,700 --> 00:19:21,570
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

338
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:30,490
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
